1
00:04:05,454 --> 00:04:11,454
You won't last the night.

2
00:08:10,909 --> 00:08:16,909
House of the Dead is a horror, action, thriller film directed by Uwe Boll.

3
00:12:16,363 --> 00:12:22,363
On an island off the coast, a techno rave party attracts a diverse
group of college coeds and a Coast Guard officer.

4
00:16:21,818 --> 00:16:27,818
Soon, they discover that their X-laced escapades are to be interrupted by zombies and monsters that
attack them on the ground, from the air, and in the sea, ruled by an evil entity.

5
00:20:27,272 --> 00:20:33,272
Rudy, played by Jonathan Cherry.

6
00:24:32,727 --> 00:24:38,727
Simon, played by Tyron Leitso.

7
00:28:38,181 --> 00:28:44,181
Salish, played by Clint Howard.

8
00:32:43,636 --> 00:32:49,636
Alicia, played by Ona Grauer.

9
00:36:49,090 --> 00:36:55,090
Cynthia, played by Sonya Salomaa.

10
00:40:54,545 --> 00:41:00,545
Casper, played by Ellie Cornell.

11
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
House of the Dead is a 2003 action horror film directed by Uwe Boll,
from a screenplay by Dave Parker and Mark Altman.

12
00:49:05,454 --> 00:49:11,454
Based on The House of the Dead video game franchise, it stars Jonathan Cherry, Tyron
Leitso, Clint Howard, Ona Grauer, Ellie Cornell, and Jürgen Prochnow.

13
00:53:10,909 --> 00:53:16,909
The film takes place on a fictional island infested by
zombies, forcing survivors to fight their way off.

14
00:57:16,363 --> 00:57:22,363
Not a direct adaptation of the individual entries, Boll described
the film as a prequel to the original 1997 game.

15
01:01:21,818 --> 01:01:27,818
House of the Dead was Boll's first film to be released
theatrically, in addition to his first video game adaptation.

16
01:05:27,272 --> 01:05:33,272
Upon release, House of the Dead was universally panned by critics, giving Boll a
negative reputation that would continue throughout his career.

17
01:09:32,727 --> 01:09:38,727
Commercially, the film grossed $13.8 million on a $12 million budget.

18
01:13:38,181 --> 01:13:44,181
A direct-to-video sequel was released in 2006, with only Cornell returning.

19
01:17:43,636 --> 01:17:49,636
House of the Dead was the last film released by Artisan
Entertainment, which merged into Lionsgate on December 15, 2003.

20
01:21:49,090 --> 01:21:55,090
The film explores themes of island, rave, based on video game.

21
01:25:54,545 --> 01:26:00,545
The tone is dark and intense.
